nding-fin-212`, I switched `round_money` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. The test cases work out under that mode: 2.675 \u2192 2.68 and 2.665 \u2192 2.66.\n- **CI:** `ci-0001` passed on commit `08d3cd5986`.\n- **PR:** #101 targets main and requests `code-owner` as reviewer.\n- **Merge:** Policy requires code-owner approval, so I asked for it before merging. The approval came back as \"Approved. Looks right.\", and PR #101 merged at `08d3cd5986`.\n\nI did not run the nightly build again, so that remains to be confirmed.", "type": "text"}]}]}